77 million, 3.2%.","cites":["APH.capex.2025","APH.revenue.2025","APH.capex.2020","APH.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"inventory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2025 was $3.4 billion, about 86 days of cost of revenue. The most in the years shown was about 93 days, at the end of FY2023.","cites":["APH.inventory.2025","APH.cost.2025","APH.inventory.2023","APH.cost.2023"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest segment in FY2025 was Communications Solutions Segment: $12.1 billion, 52% of revenue.","cites":["APH.mix.segment.2025.0","APH.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2025 was Other Foreign Locations: $11.4 billion, 50% of revenue.","cites":["APH.mix.geography.2025.0","APH.revenue.2025"]}]}}